	(text "PHYRSTB is a 3.3 V input: U902 74LVC1G07 (1V8 supply) open drain, R932 10k to 3V3, C901 filter.\nR933 1k holds eth_rst_n (MIO9) low against the MIO reset pull-up until software releases the PHY."
